message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "SRD 5.2.1 System JSON"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Chow"
    given-names: "Chee Leong"
version: "0.2.0"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
url: "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/"
abstract: >-
  A source-faithful JSON-LD 1.1 reference corpus and JSON Schema Draft
  2020-12 specifications for the System Reference Document 5.2.1 by
  Wizards of the Coast LLC (CC-BY-4.0). Includes rules, tables, classes,
  subclasses, species, backgrounds, feats, equipment, spells, conditions,
  magic items, and monster stat blocks with line-level source provenance.
references:
